    <description>A zero-dependency network inspector and MCP server. Your AI assistant can debug HTTP, HTTPS and WebSocket traffic while every secret is scrubbed before the model sees it.

After installing, register it with your MCP clients: `nullwire-mcp install --client all`.
Remove the entries before uninstalling: `nullwire-mcp install --uninstall --client all`.</description>
